# Round six, item language (I3): every step of a node

* `NetOK c`: what the level procedure needs from the network `c.net` (gate class, normalized
  children, the data block of its operator);
* `eStH`: the scale of a step; `sum_eStH`: the steps of a node have total scale
  `cLH c + ∑_{children} Gs (s F)`;
* `rImplQ_listH`: a list of implemented `HStep`s implements `denListH`;
* **`step_anyH`**: every step of `c.net` at a node on `E` bits, coded by `stepH`, has an
  implementation with constant cost `≤ (child cost) + (MlocH + 18 CR (F+1)^τ) · W n · Yu`.
